{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は大阪ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママ、いとこたち、おじいちゃん、おばあちゃん、おばさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てました(￣∇￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかんだ\n埼玉で育ったわりには\n大阪で産まれて\nママの実家が大阪にあるから\n1年に2回は行く感じで\n馴染みあるんだよね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい、\nとゆーわけで\n恒例のレポです∩(∵)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のMCは\nWさゆりがやってくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりん、ゆっきーなは欠席\n若月は体調不良でミニライブだけ\n頑張ってくれました(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは前回と一緒の"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛を"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC自己紹介"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリのレクチャー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の詩\n＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！Bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回物販の方は\nグッズ増えてたみたいです(*・ω・)ノ\nうちわとか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8レーン\n岩瀬、中田でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日楽しかったね、ほんとに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブもたくさんのかた来てくれたし\nすごい盛り上げてくださって\nステージでめちゃくちゃ楽しかった！\n大阪は特にあったかいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにより\nngng良かったね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんが優良剥がしだったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉と中田のペアって\nなんかいいみたいね、\nって自分で言うほど良かったと\n中田は思う(・ω・)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったかた\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回が\n2ndシングル『おいでシャンプー』の最後のイベで\nおいシャンをやる機会も少なくなったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日いい最終日をむかえられて\nほんと良かった(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3rdはもう始まってます\nこれからもよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーと\nもうひとーつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段マンガもあんま読まないし\nアニメもAKB0048以外あんま見ないから\nなんのことかわかんなかったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の前の記事のコメで\nみんながナルトナルトって言うから\nなんのことやらと思ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルトに\nアマテラスとかスサノオとかイザナギとか\n技の名前？で出てくるんだね(゜ロ゜)\n生駒ちゃんに聞いたよ(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりにくくてすみません、\nヲタ芸の技の名前で言いました＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/6243745/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ngng終わった直後の写メ！\n8レーンいえあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ngngで髪が乱れるとゆーヲタ芸（￣＾￣）dy"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}